  "attack_surface": "OPEN: prove \u2016\u03ba_orth\u2016\u00b2 \u2264 room\u00b7((d\u22121)/d)\u00b2 for all primes p\u22655 (\u21d4 \u03ba\u00b2 \u2264 \u03ba_hyp \u21d4 \u2016\u03ba\u2016\u00b2 \u2264 96n). Dual-frame proj, ED4_flat\u2264Wick, and \u03ba_hyp\u226496n are proved. Certified \u03ba\u00b2=\u03ba_hyp at p=3,5. Halfspace sub-orbit alone can exceed Wick \u2014 full Max+ required. With orth bound + 15.98: bi-tight for Paley p\u22655. Then N_DEEP.",
  "verdict": "Prop 15.100 proves dual-frame projection \u2016\u03ba_proj\u2016\u00b2=64n(p\u00b2\u22123)/(p\u00b2\u22125), flat Veronese bound ED4_flat\u2264Wick (eq only p=3), and \u03ba_hyp\u226496n algebra. Reduces \u2016\u03ba\u2016\u00b2\u226496n to \u2016\u03ba_orth\u2016\u00b2\u2264room\u00b7((d\u22121)/d)\u00b2. Certified equality \u03ba\u00b2=\u03ba_hyp at p=3,5. General orth bound OPEN. lim \u03b1_n OPEN.",
  "settlement_note": "Next: prove orth bound (PSL isotypic / closed-form E[D\u2074] for full Max+), then bi-tight via 15.98+15.100; then N_DEEP + Main Theorem. L stays OPEN.",
  "proved": true
